{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/075-zi-yi/maruichen-tongshi","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/075-zi-yi/maruichen-tongshi/data.json","title":"毛詩傳箋通釋 · 緇衣 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 鄭風 · 緇衣 · 汇集《毛詩傳箋通釋》关于《緇衣》的 1 条注释，含 1 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"075-zi-yi","materialId":"maruichen-tongshi"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/075-zi-yi/maruichen-tongshi","poem":{"id":"075-zi-yi","title":"緇衣","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"zhengfeng","path":["風","鄭風","緇衣"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"緇衣之宜兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-002","text":"敝予又改爲兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-003","text":"適子之館兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-004","text":"還予授子之粲兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-005","text":"緇衣之好兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-006","text":"敝予又改造兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-007","text":"適子之館兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-008","text":"還予授子之粲兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-009","text":"緇衣之蓆兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-010","text":"敝予又改作兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-011","text":"適子之館兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-012","text":"還予授子之粲兮","isActive":true}]},"material":{"id":"maruichen-tongshi","title":"毛詩傳箋通釋","authors":["馬瑞辰"],"contributorLine":"清 · 馬瑞辰","era":"清","publicationYear":1989,"carrier":"PDF"},"stats":{"annotationCount":1,"glossCount":1},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":1,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"緇衣之宜兮，敝予又改爲兮。適子之館兮，還予授子之粲兮。緇衣之好兮，敝予又改造兮。適子之館兮，還予授子之粲兮。緇衣之蓆兮，敝予又改作兮。適子之館兮，還予授子之粲兮。","targetNotes":"全篇通释。","sourceLabel":"第 365-366 页","sourceNotes":"据 /private/tmp/075-maruichen-body/p397.png（书内页 365，题面《緇衣》）及 /private/tmp/075-maruichen-body/p398.png（书内页 366，续释）定位。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"马瑞辰","sectionLabel":"通释","text":"马瑞辰释《緇衣》，以《序》“美武公”立篇，谓郑武公父子并为周司徒而国人宜之，故作此诗以美其德。又随文申说“緇衣”为卿士退朝治事时所服之衣，“改爲”“適子之館”“授子之粲”皆见礼贤周至，不作男女相悦之辞。","notes":"依据页图 /private/tmp/075-maruichen-body/p397.png、p398.png 保守摘录。"}]}]}}}
